refused: program.unio:2:24, line 2 column 24
 2 |     let $roll: Whole = random(from: 6, to: 1);
   |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:     `    let $roll: Whole = random(from: 1, to: 6);`
 why:     `random` gives a whole number from `from:` up to `to:`, so `from:` can't be above `to:`.
